{
    "title": "Ninja Ryuko: Shadow Ninja Game",
    "description": "Are you looking for a ninja shadow fight battle game with a blend of ninja warrior and samurai regions fighting gameplay? Ryuko Rpg is a shadow ninja game packed with five  regions of Kurome, addictive gameplay, epic boss fights, offline battles, and an open world adventure gameplay experience. \r\nA realistic shadow fighting game with unique regions in which the ninja will have to defend his land!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfef<b>NINJA SHADOW GAME</b>\ud83c\udfef\r\n\r\nRyuko Shadow Hunter:Ninja Game\r\nKurome was a land of regions with shadow ninja warriors but the people were corrupted due to greed. They occupied more regions and they continued fighting in the dark shadow. Ryuko is a young and brave shadow ninja who enters Kurome in search of Taguchi Sensei ending corruption in the regions.\r\n\r\nCorrupted Regions\r\nRyuko will be presented with five ninja world regions. Brutal shadow warrior enemies will be presented in these ninja fighting game. These regions contain a Hunter's Castle for resting, character and fighting upgrades. \r\n\r\nBlack Eye Fortress Regions\r\nGame starts in black eye fortress where the ninja learns basic fighting mechanics. Player defeats initial enemies and learns about stealth kills, finisher fighting moves and uninterrupted shadow attacks. The ninja learns to loot weapons and level up character level.\r\n\r\nCreek Garden\r\nThis is one of the most colorful regions of Kurome. Ryuko faces more brutal shadow ninja enemies in the Creek Garden. Player explores a hunter's castle, a safe place to rest from fighting. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc09<b>MULTIPLE KUROME REGIONS</b>\ud83d\udc09\r\n\r\nMangle Woods\r\nA shadow region designed to be played in stealth game mode. Ninja Ryuko will be fighting firey demons which can only be killed with stealth attacks from the shadow. \r\n\r\nDeserted Castle Regions\r\nRyuko explores the shadow and open regions of Kurome here, fighting more monsters, some random ninja, fiery demons, and hunters.\r\n\r\nMinistry Shadow Town\r\nNinja Ryuko faces ministry regions hunters in battle arenas regions. All the ministry hunters needed to be defeated in order to free Taguchi Sensei.\r\n\r\nThroughout the game, you will encounter detailed ninja shadow characters and discover regions. You will use different kinds of swords, elixir, and skills to control the game.This will be a perfect battleground for fighting and matching ninja assassin and shadow fighting game skills. \r\n\r\nEpic Boss Fighting\r\nThis role playing ninja shadow game makes you play as a last shadow warrior who faces epic boss fights in the regions of tremendous breadth and beauty. Trained in the ways of a legendary shadow warrior, Ninja Ryuko's eventual aim is to play as a brave shadow fighter and end the regions corruption.\r\n\r\n\u2694\ufe0f<b>FIGHTING SHADOW FEATURES</b>\u2694\ufe0f\r\n\r\nNinja Shadow Game Features:\r\n\ud83c\udfeeFighting ninja selection\r\n\ud83c\udfeeMany boss enemies\r\n\ud83c\udfeeMany types of swords\r\n\ud83c\udfeeMany types of regions\r\n\ud83c\udfeeStealth game mode\r\n\ud83c\udfeeDeath fighting move\r\n\ud83c\udfeeFast travel\r\n\ud83c\udfeeRealistic ninja battlegrounds\r\n\r\nThis action rpg is the finest sword fighting offline game with samurai ninja enemies. If you like a fighting game and are looking for an offline game with realistic graphics, this game is what you are looking for. Download for free now and experience the fun of pure ninja fighting gameplay.\r\n\r\nUpgrade your ninja to free Kurome in this fighting game!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Are you looking for a ninja shadow fight battle game with a blend of ninja warrior and samurai regions fighting gameplay? Ryuko Rpg is a shadow ninja game packed with five  regions of Kurome, addictive gameplay, epic boss fights, offline battles, and an open world adventure gameplay experience. <br>A realistic shadow fighting game with unique regions in which the ninja will have to defend his land!<br><br>\ud83c\udfef<b>NINJA SHADOW GAME</b>\ud83c\udfef<br><br>Ryuko Shadow Hunter:Ninja Game<br>Kurome was a land of regions with shadow ninja warriors but the people were corrupted due to greed. They occupied more regions and they continued fighting in the dark shadow. Ryuko is a young and brave shadow ninja who enters Kurome in search of Taguchi Sensei ending corruption in the regions.<br><br>Corrupted Regions<br>Ryuko will be presented with five ninja world regions. Brutal shadow warrior enemies will be presented in these ninja fighting game. These regions contain a Hunter&#39;s Castle for resting, character and fighting upgrades. <br><br>Black Eye Fortress Regions<br>Game starts in black eye fortress where the ninja learns basic fighting mechanics. Player defeats initial enemies and learns about stealth kills, finisher fighting moves and uninterrupted shadow attacks. The ninja learns to loot weapons and level up character level.<br><br>Creek Garden<br>This is one of the most colorful regions of Kurome. Ryuko faces more brutal shadow ninja enemies in the Creek Garden. Player explores a hunter&#39;s castle, a safe place to rest from fighting. <br><br>\ud83d\udc09<b>MULTIPLE KUROME REGIONS</b>\ud83d\udc09<br><br>Mangle Woods<br>A shadow region designed to be played in stealth game mode. Ninja Ryuko will be fighting firey demons which can only be killed with stealth attacks from the shadow. <br><br>Deserted Castle Regions<br>Ryuko explores the shadow and open regions of Kurome here, fighting more monsters, some random ninja, fiery demons, and hunters.<br><br>Ministry Shadow Town<br>Ninja Ryuko faces ministry regions hunters in battle arenas regions. All the ministry hunters needed to be defeated in order to free Taguchi Sensei.<br><br>Throughout the game, you will encounter detailed ninja shadow characters and discover regions. You will use different kinds of swords, elixir, and skills to control the game.This will be a perfect battleground for fighting and matching ninja assassin and shadow fighting game skills. <br><br>Epic Boss Fighting<br>This role playing ninja shadow game makes you play as a last shadow warrior who faces epic boss fights in the regions of tremendous breadth and beauty. Trained in the ways of a legendary shadow warrior, Ninja Ryuko&#39;s eventual aim is to play as a brave shadow fighter and end the regions corruption.<br><br>\u2694\ufe0f<b>FIGHTING SHADOW FEATURES</b>\u2694\ufe0f<br><br>Ninja Shadow Game Features:<br>\ud83c\udfeeFighting ninja selection<br>\ud83c\udfeeMany boss enemies<br>\ud83c\udfeeMany types of swords<br>\ud83c\udfeeMany types of regions<br>\ud83c\udfeeStealth game mode<br>\ud83c\udfeeDeath fighting move<br>\ud83c\udfeeFast travel<br>\ud83c\udfeeRealistic ninja battlegrounds<br><br>This action rpg is the finest sword fighting offline game with samurai ninja enemies. If you like a fighting game and are looking for an offline game with realistic graphics, this game is what you are looking for. Download for free now and experience the fun of pure ninja fighting gameplay.<br><br>Upgrade your ninja to free Kurome in this fighting game!",
